gms-lib
=======

Reads, patches and writes GameMaker Studio game files (data.win, bytecode
versions 14 to 16).

Copyright (C) 2026 Dapper Mink, licensed GPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE.

Depends on, through the UndertaleModTool submodule (not copied into this
repository):

- UndertaleModLib <https://github.com/UnderminersTeam/UndertaleModTool>:
  GPL-3.0. This library is therefore GPL-3.0. Upstream states "GPLv3" without
  an explicit "or later", so this repository takes the conservative reading,
  GPL-3.0-only -- safe under either reading of upstream's intent. The submodule
  points at the fork <https://github.com/QuentinJanuel/UndertaleModTool>,
  under the same licence.
- Underanalyzer <https://github.com/UnderminersTeam/Underanalyzer>: MPL-2.0.
  UndertaleModTool's own submodule, pointing at the fork
  <https://github.com/QuentinJanuel/Underanalyzer>, whose modified files stay
  available there under MPL-2.0.

.editorconfig is taken from OpenGM <https://github.com/misternebula/OpenGM>,
